    "rating": 3.4,
    "reference": "ChIJSRV2UzE2yUwRmBdNbLfEesE",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "ML Le",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114871566278470565682/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJtMfHhTlCNIfTcvd1pibBNwCNWJm0ozivJdwZ-gvTA4tza=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "We have been going to the Vaudreuil store since summer of 2023 and the owners have been great with me, my 2 kids. They take the time to assess our needs and making sure it respects our budget. They are straight to the point and they don't try to sell you something you don't need. We really appreciate their honesty and helpfulness.",
        "time": 1717600958,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "S",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108526767788928884276/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU3G88fk7oXE3uUHevFrTzely9ZHvfmXUYB4QdkVDFDwTpEuqEq=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Had a bad experience with the man who works at the store, he was incredibly rude and condescending. I don’t know if it’s because we were English or POC, but he was aggressive with us all even though I was responding to him in French. He snapped at me when I opened one of the boxes saying I wasn’t allowed to open it as it’s his job, which would have been fine if he said it nicely or there was a sign. At then end we bought a pair, and he didn’t say it was final sale until AFTER we paid, which he finally spoke in English and said goodbye. Never going again and don’t recommend. First and last time.",
        "time": 1731884160,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Erica M.",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118049768905847860738/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJvk9KcAmlVJfHpSebOz9NFhqbxFuvk21zUHeIEPyYo8A2BuA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Had a terrible experience this afternoon, the guy was yelling at me from the other end of the store, then said something in French so I said pardon? The guy got upset and called over the store clerk the lady couldn't get me the boot size so we kept looking. Then an older lady who doesn't work there told me I'm not allowed to touch anything. So I said I was leaving, and in the background they said good go. Poor service and refuses to speak English",
        "time": 1670098652,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Vanessa",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110736974537496527709/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXDf-YGYBIaf258yXpezFva9iUtobyc7I4-Wl5R1KGvO0G4O4dRhA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "I've been coming here for the past 5 years. I can always find the right pair of shoes for my boys. The prices are great and the staff is very friendly.",
        "time": 1740288916,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Serban Moldoveanu",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116277794119541727034/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLrqJtbQRaR7ybUSGvLoG13C93QwisP9CzhAv0A3xAVex0dWQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Used to go to this store to get shoes for all my family but no more. I wanted to get a pair for me and all these disinfectants that you need to apply when enter in all the stores damaged my hands skin up to bleeding. The doctor recommended not to use them directly on my hands so instead getting nitrile gloves and disinfect them to protect my skin. Surprise, when getting in the store the owner insisted to take out the gloves. I explained that I cannot do that as it will worsen my condition but instead I will disinfect the gloves (exactly the same result and win-win situation). He insisted and said that this is the law. Really?? Logic did not worked with him so I did not had other choice but to leave. And so he just lost not one customer but 4. I give 2 stars because in the past I was satisfied with their service.",
        "time": 1644358107,
        "translated": false
      }
